From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 18:26:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: defconfig: Enable the Allwinner A733 IOMMU

Enable the driver for the two IOMMUs of the Allwinner A733, as used on
the Radxa Cubie A7S. The option is a bool, as SUN50I_IOMMU is, so the
driver is built in.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: booted on two boards; the kernel carries
CONFIG_SUN60I_IOMMU=y and both instances bind.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 arch/arm64/configs/defconfig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
index 6ec8d3a69c98..271ccabfc378 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
@@ -1618,6 +1618,7 @@ CONFIG_ARM_SMMU=y
 CONFIG_ARM_SMMU_V3=y
 CONFIG_QCOM_IOMMU=y
 CONFIG_ROCKCHIP_IOMMU=y
+CONFIG_SUN60I_IOMMU=y
 CONFIG_TEGRA_IOMMU_SMMU=y
 CONFIG_APPLE_DART=m
 CONFIG_MTK_IOMMU=y
